{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1440935-apply-before-the-roll","id":1440935,"title":"apply before the roll?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-03-22T05:56:21-07:00","id":1440935,"title":"apply before the roll?","content":"Hello,<br /> <br /> in the calling Judge, 2 knacks (Indisputable Analysis and On the Case) give success and enhancement respectively to aplly before the roll.<br /> I don't understand the &quot;apply before the roll&quot;? What's the point?<br /> Someone can explain this?<br /> <br /> Thanks in advance!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26485-mk3ultimate","name":"mk3ultimate","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-22T06:35:40-07:00","id":1440939,"title":"","content":"As a general rule, enhancements apply only after the roll, what means, if you don\u2019t get any success in the roll you get no enhancements.<br /> <br /> Those successes/enhancements applied before the roll mean they will apply even if you botch, turning the botch into a success. Also you get access to the regular enhancements, even if you roll no successes in the dice, because it\u2019s considered a successful roll.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_bl